---
Stdout:
ST102  Server error on undeclared request Content-Type
checks not_a_server_error

5xx for a request sent with an undeclared `Content-Type`, while the same request
with a declared one succeeds.

Schemathesis sends media types the operation doesn't declare, and multipart
without a boundary. Reject them with `415` or `400` before the body parser runs.

`--exclude-checks not_a_server_error` turns it off, along with ST101, ST113,
ST119.
